5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry our instincts about promise have not aged well. I want to see what finished awards actually delivered.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,Money is easy to vote. Trained hands are not. I need to know who is genuinely available here now.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,Nothing runs in isolation. We rely on shared services. I must check the current state of those facilities.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The headline grant size is static, but what it buys changes. I need to see where costs have shifted.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,Recent awards lost time to non-scientific interruptions. I want to know where work in this field gets delayed.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, do you think the budget lines tell the whole story of value?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Victoria, if the facilities are strained, does that affect the staffing availability I am checking?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, likely. If the infrastructure fails, the people cannot work. We are looking at the same bottleneck.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shizue, the ledgers show frozen costs, but the real value is in what the agency still absorbs centrally.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I agree with @Victoria. Interruptions often come from outside the lab. We should look at the broader support systems.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the closeout files to see which projects actually sustained their impact over time.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will check the staffing rolls to see which technical roles have been hollowed out by industry.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will review the accreditation and bookings to see if the shared facilities have the spare capacity we assume.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will examine the travel and bench-fee lines to see which costs are now landing on the awardee.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will look at the incident logs to see where shared instrumentation has caused the most downtime.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,It is better to trust the record than the reputation.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"The people are the project. If they are gone, the grant is dead.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,We cannot fund a project that breaks the system it depends on.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Clarity on costs prevents the quiet erosion of the grant's actual reach.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Midori,,Let us hope the data shows us where the friction lies before we commit.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
